sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant DeviceA as Device A
  participant AuthAPI as Auth API
  participant UserDB as MongoDB User
  participant TokenDB as Refresh Token Store
  participant Socket as Socket.IO
  participant DeviceB as Device B

  Note over DeviceA,DeviceB: Both devices hold access tokens with tokenVersion 0
  User->>DeviceA: Trigger logout all
  DeviceA->>AuthAPI: POST /auth/logout-all with access token A
  AuthAPI->>UserDB: Start MongoDB transaction
  AuthAPI->>TokenDB: Revoke all refresh tokens
  TokenDB-->>AuthAPI: Revocation staged
  AuthAPI->>UserDB: Atomic $inc tokenVersion
  UserDB-->>AuthAPI: tokenVersion 1 staged
  AuthAPI->>UserDB: Commit transaction
  UserDB-->>AuthAPI: Revocation persisted atomically
  AuthAPI->>Socket: Emit auth:session-revoked
  AuthAPI-->>DeviceA: Success
  Socket-->>DeviceA: Clear auth and redirect
  Socket-->>DeviceB: Clear auth and redirect

  opt Device B missed socket event
    DeviceB->>AuthAPI: Protected request with tokenVersion 0
    AuthAPI->>UserDB: Read current tokenVersion
    UserDB-->>AuthAPI: tokenVersion 1
    AuthAPI-->>DeviceB: 401 Token revoked
  end

  User->>DeviceB: Login again
  DeviceB->>AuthAPI: Valid credentials
  AuthAPI->>UserDB: Read current tokenVersion
  UserDB-->>AuthAPI: tokenVersion 1
  AuthAPI-->>DeviceB: New access token with tokenVersion 1

